# M3 round 4 (2026-10-21): G-ECO-1 (seed 1111, 5000 steps, thirst off) on
# v3-m3-model-hydration. Evidence: every 1000-step dev/validation run now
# survives, but over 5000 steps thirst off Cheetah dies at step 2080 while
# Gazelle is still at 1697 (a predator-prey cycle Cheetah does not recover
# from). Satiation (B) damps overkill cycles; it was only judged on 1000-step
# balance before. Run with --steps=5000 --seeds=1111 --thirst=off.
axis predation.satiationFraction=0,0.8,0.9
axis predation.refugeCount=8,10,12
axis predation.cheetahSkillScale=1.0,1.2
